      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 30000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.06\n    loan_term_years = 5\n    extra_monthly_payment = 100\n\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    regular_monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -number_of_payments)\n    )\n\n    remaining_principal = principal\n    total_cost = 0\n\n    while remaining_principal > 0:\n        interest_payment = remaining_principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        principal_payment = (\n            regular_monthly_payment\n            - interest_payment\n            + extra_monthly_payment\n        )\n\n        remaining_principal -= principal_payment\n        total_cost += regular_monthly_payment + extra_monthly_payment\n\n    # Return the total cost rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_cost)\n```",
